            "value": "We can't reach RunWear's server right now, so your photos can't be uploaded yet. Nothing was sent. You can try again later — your recommendations are unchanged."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ahora mismo no podemos contactar con el servidor de RunWear, así que tus fotos aún no se pueden subir. No se ha enviado nada. Puedes intentarlo más tarde: tus recomendaciones no cambian."
          }
        }
      }
    },
